---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>7 Exclusive Guides — Droparabia</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/Droparabia.webp" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      @font-face {
        font-family: 'iBrand';
        src: url('/ibrand-font/ibrand.otf') format('opentype');
        font-weight: normal;
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: block;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        background: #F0F0F0;
        color: #000;
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .text-section {
        padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero-heading {
        font-family: 'iBrand', sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
        line-height: 1;
        color: #000;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .hero-sub {
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #222;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .guide-image {
        width: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 45vh;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      .btn-section {
        padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
      }

      .dl-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 16px 36px;
        background: #020887;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(2,8,135,0.30);
      }

      .dl-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(2,8,135,0.40);
      }

      .dl-btn svg { flex-shrink: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:100vh; padding:2rem; text-align:center; gap:1rem;">
    <h1 style="font-family:'iBrand',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.6rem); color:#000; line-height:1.2;">The event is over</h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:500; color:#333; max-width:380px; line-height:1.6;">The guides are no longer available. See you in the next event!</p>
  </body>
</html>
